{"id":2880,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><div><div><p>为切实贯彻学校学生工作部关于假期学生公寓安全管理的工作要求，筑牢寒假前校园安全防线，保障学生生命财产安全与校园稳定，根据学校相关工作部署，体育学院于2026年1月23日上午开展寒假前学生公寓安全隐患全面排查工作。本次排查在党委副书记李建国的带队下，全体辅导员、班主任共同参与，针对学生宿舍安全风险点及卫生状况进行全方位、无死角检查。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=/nmCKYL4UaMz7anONQfozVkL7-YMzNxYnRQRMl7aLlVRnRC0gihFp2hmCIa0M1hknSh7MShVMRM7LmAVMzQRUz9YUznRMRrRMNM7UmlPMzMFnmvPnRT2LRWFMmN8M4NJqjfjo4Oeosnb_dN0qIbtpYyPLRUPg47iMR7sgtA8pUJcc&oid=1054562613&tid=1041&nid=15417&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/6BED5E43D28E56CA82A4C45C6CDB5153/F71D9F02/69479\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=/oRGKaLNW7nzviLOz9PLmUZoRr7LR7xYLRT2L8-PMllaLmL0gihFp2hmCIa0oSy8n1hkMYh7nm6VM8W7MR67U8laMz7ZLlVfnz67n77anzrFnmA2L4CsM8QFL4QknmrfgtXaQ4Oeo4x8_5AbgDTJQty0LzG8LSyPMzUPMYbw62J8c&oid=1054562613&tid=1041&nid=15417&e=.jpg\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=/U8MKRM4GZM4TkMOzNiU4LbLmNbLmLx4L7QRozUiU4NaMz-0gihFp2hmCIa0LYyZnShVMYy4n7liolQ7LNVkLNQfUz94LRrfMmrfollanzTFMRA2Lm7anRVFM8UaLmvJqjfjo4Oeosnb_dN0qIbtpYyPLRUPg47iMR7sgtA8pUJcc&oid=1054562613&tid=1041&nid=15417&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/38EE73DE59FD2AB2FAA8305A65A9E0E9/48F210D1/7D027\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=/U46KRLzCZMlMkLOm9iMNWRLmG4UmTxVU8CbMR7sLN-4nzv0gihFp2hmCIa0MkhfnShVUYyDMm98MNLPo7UaUzUioRLsM7CPoRUDo7L4LRMFLNl8ozvbL4AFL8nkUNMVgtXaQ4Oeo4x8_5AbgDTJQty0LzG8LSyPMzUPMYbw62J8c&oid=1054562613&tid=1041&nid=15417&e=.jpg\"></p><p><br></p></div></div></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://tyxy.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=/nmCKYL4UaMz7anONQfozVkL7-YMzNxYnRQRMl7aLlVRnRC0gihFp2hmCIa0M1hknSh7MShVMRM7LmAVMzQRUz9YUznRMRrRMNM7UmlPMzMFnmvPnRT2LRWFMmN8M4NJqjfjo4Oeosnb_dN0qIbtpYyPLRUPg47iMR7sgtA8pUJcc&oid=1054562613&tid=1041&nid=15417&e=.jpg"}